===============================================================================
 EXPERIMENT 1: Concurrency Dispatch (20,000 tasks, 4 workers)                
===============================================================================
Method              Mean (ms)  Min (ms)   Max (ms)   StdDev (ms)  Latency/op     Throughput
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pure C (pthread)      404.25     382.54     463.94      30.658     20212.3 ns        49475 ops/s
Cplus (ThreadPool)     20.05      17.31      22.72       2.180      1002.5 ns       997535 ops/s
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Speedup: 20.16x faster | Parity: 100.0% BIT-EXACT (Checksum: 0x00002707B6C16DEC)

===============================================================================
 EXPERIMENT 2: Modbus CRC16 (1,000,000 frames x 10 bytes = 10 MB)              
===============================================================================
Method              Mean (ms)  Min (ms)   Max (ms)   StdDev (ms)  Latency/op     Throughput
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pure C (bitwise)      111.52     110.64     113.50       1.095       111.5 ns      8966790 frames/s
Cplus (LUT Table)      14.47      12.41      17.07       1.521        14.5 ns     69105817 frames/s (659.0 MB/s)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Speedup: 7.71x faster | Parity: 100.0% BIT-EXACT (Checksum: 0x00000007B6F679A6)

